# Scenario

At approximately **14:10 on <date>**, customers reported that the Normain web application was returning errors and the API was failing. Investigation found the **primary production database (Azure) unavailable, with core tables missing**, after a data-migration script was accidentally run against the production environment instead of staging. The customer-facing product was effectively down.

Recovery centred on **restoring the production database from the most recent automated backup** (taken ~02:00, ~12 hours prior — within the 24-hour RPO), **verifying data integrity**, and cutting back over. Target recovery time was **12 hours (RTO, Appendix B)**; no security breach or data exfiltration was involved.
